    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis derelict 2 bedroom cottage is located approximately 8kms from Kilrush town in a rural setting with mainly one off private houses. Situated on a 0.58 acre site with nice countryside views and some external outbuildings. Planning permission was granted to demolish the existing cottage and reconstruct a new replacement house - reference number P19/547. This was later extended under reference P25/375.\n\nThis property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant which is up to 50,000 and potentially may qualify for an additional 20,000 derelict house refurbishment grant. In addition, it may also qualify for Sustainable Energy Authority of Ireland (SEAI) grants.\n\nBER Exempt."
